  {
    "id": "bare_act_Consumer_Protection_Act_2019_txt_sec_82_6",
    "text": "[Consumer Protection Act 2019 - Section 82: Product Liability Action]\nSection 82. Product Liability Action.\n(1) An action for product liability may be brought by a complainant against a product manufacturer or a product seller or a product service provider for any harm caused to him on account of a defective product.\n(2) A product manufacturer shall be liable in a product liability action if the product contains a manufacturing defect, or is defective in design, or deviates from manufacturing specifications.",
